<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Say So (Japanese Version)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Rainych"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1505586937"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">从长夜到破晓一直伴我身旁</text><text for="L2">明明递了暗示你还不肯说出口吗？</text><text for="L3">全然未察便再无计可施</text><text for="L4">若渴望拥有我就大声说出来吧</text><text for="L5">从深夜到拂晓寸步不离左右</text><text for="L6">暗送秋波你还不肯吐露心声吗？</text><text for="L7">浑然不觉教我彻底没了办法</text><text for="L8">想要得到我就亲口对我说啊</text><text for="L9">你是从何时起</text><text for="L10">不再轻启心扉</text><text for="L11">无法坦露心迹的你究竟怎么了</text><text for="L12">究竟要我如何是好？</text><text for="L13">快告诉我吧</text><text for="L14">你的小心思早被我看穿</text><text for="L15">想就此打住却又欲罢不能</text><text for="L16">继续这样周旋倒也无妨</text><text for="L17">彼此推拉试探见招拆招</text><text for="L18">若真心想要就放胆喊出来</text><text for="L19">非得放手一搏不可</text><text for="L20">彻夜流连直到天明伴我身侧</text><text for="L21">给足了暗示你怎么还不表白？</text><text for="L22">丝毫未曾留意再无可施之计</text><text for="L23">想要我就痛快承认吧</text><text for="L24">沉醉今宵直到破晓别离开我</text><text for="L25">眉目传情你还不肯挑明吗？</text><text for="L26">全无察觉便再无解法</text><text for="L27">渴望我那就直接坦白吧</text><text for="L28">挺起胸膛屏住呼吸</text><text for="L29">从未见过我身着这般迷人的裙装</text><text for="L30">世间再难觅如此绝美尤物</text><text for="L31">大概正因如此你才紧闭双唇一语不发</text><text for="L32">爱意难平迷恋不已令人难以自拔</text><text for="L33">揽入怀中据为己有将心俘获</text><text for="L34">小哥别再玩弄心机了全神贯注看着我</text><text for="L35">何须拘谨客套犹犹豫豫</text><text for="L36">收起借口迈开步子大胆向前</text><text for="L37">老实交代你的真心</text><text for="L38">深知你渴望拥有眼前这般风情万种的我</text><text for="L39">不妨亲自来品尝一番滋味 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(ya ya)</span></text><text for="L40">纵使旁人百般非议冷眼旁观</text><text for="L41">我也依然有你依偎身旁</text><text for="L42">朋友们都说你对我深陷其中无比专一</text><text for="L43">比任何人都要真挚赤诚无可替代</text><text for="L44">这曼妙身姿曲线任由你尽情抚摸</text><text for="L45">自暮色至晨曦静静守候我身侧</text><text for="L46">心意已决递出暗号你仍缄口不言吗？</text><text for="L47">茫然不解教我黔驴技穷别无他法</text><text for="L48">若恋慕我便大声呼喊出来吧</text><text for="L49">长夜连绵直到黎明 频频递出暗号</text><text for="L50">你却始终懵懂未察</text><text for="L51">若是渴求我就亲口言明吧</text><text for="L52">自入夜直到天光破晓伴我左右</text><text for="L53">暗号早已送达你还不肯坦白吗？</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:37.486"><div begin="0:10.730" end="3:37.486"><p begin="0:10.730" end="0:14.650" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.730" end="0:11.390">夜</span><span begin="0:11.390" end="0:11.740">朝</span><span begin="0:11.740" end="0:12.300">ま</span><span begin="0:12.300" end="0:12.500">で</span><span begin="0:12.660" end="0:12.920">ずっ</span><span begin="0:12.920" end="0:13.150">と</span><span begin="0:13.150" end="0:13.450">そ</span><span begin="0:13.450" end="0:13.760">ば</span><span begin="0:13.760" end="0:14.000">に</span><span begin="0:14.110" end="0:14.400">い</span><span begin="0:14.400" end="0:14.650">て</span></p><p begin="0:14.910" end="0:18.970" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.910" end="0:15.330">合</span><span begin="0:15.330" end="0:15.670">図</span><span begin="0:15.670" end="0:15.810">を</span><span begin="0:15.810" end="0:16.100">し</span><span begin="0:16.100" end="0:16.610">たっ</span><span begin="0:16.610" end="0:16.820">て</span><span begin="0:17.060" end="0:17.200">言</span><span begin="0:17.200" end="0:17.430">わ</span><span begin="0:17.430" end="0:17.850">な</span><span begin="0:17.850" end="0:18.330">い</span><span begin="0:18.330" end="0:18.970">の？</span></p><p begin="0:19.380" end="0:23.290" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.380" end="0